{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37266","headline":"织锦妇 · 秦韬玉","name":"织锦妇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃花日日觅新奇，有镜何曾及画眉。\n祗恐轻梭难作匹，岂辞纤手遍生胝。\n合蝉巧间双盘带，联鴈斜衔小折枝。\n豪贵大堆酬曲彻，可怜辛苦一丝丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}